0..63 Comment "/// This source states the group laws of the circle loop space."
64..67 Comment "///"
68..129 Comment "/// The laws compare `wind` and `spin` with integer addition."
130..190 Comment "/// The loops commute because their winding numbers commute."
191..194 Comment "///"
195..259 Comment "/// The checker proves each law by word conversion or `Path.ap`."
260..263 Comment "///"
264..346 Comment "/// Limits: `ΩS¹≡ℤ` needs univalence. `isSetΩS¹` and `toPropElim` need the"
347..426 Comment "/// h-level ladder. `basedΩS¹ x ≡ ℤ` at every point needs equivalences as"
427..441 Comment "/// structure."
